effectively.

00:01:38.103 --> 00:01:42.546
And, last year I had the privilege of
seeing Salcon at the TED Conference.

00:01:42.546 --> 00:01:45.307
Saw him speak at a company here in the Bay

00:01:45.307 --> 00:01:48.834
area, and we began our dialog to have him
come in.

00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:53.918
Before I introduce the student who will
introduce Sal to you, there's one

00:01:53.918 --> 00:01:58.450
event in particular that I wanna be sure
that I mention to you.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:03.320
And that is, that we have a viewing of the
