00:24:11.929 --> 00:24:15.200
a very good game, actually, maybe the
business school should look into it.

00:24:15.200 --> 00:24:18.476
But, but the, while, while that was
happening,

00:24:18.476 --> 00:24:20.443
I, I got a text message from Ann.

00:24:20.443 --> 00:24:23.169
And, and the text, you know, text messages
