00:24:31.290 --> 00:24:33.065
And I was like, Ann knows people that Bill

00:24:33.065 --> 00:24:35.094
Gates would talk about, so maybe this was,
you

00:24:35.094 --> 00:24:37.275
know, some type of, you know, she wouldn't
have

00:24:37.275 --> 00:24:40.220
a, she didn't seem like much of a
prankster here.

00:24:40.220 --> 00:24:42.583
But I was like, is, you know, what's going
