00:24:42.583 --> 00:24:44.133
So I immediately, I went on to, and I

00:24:44.133 --> 00:24:46.483
booted the nearest 7th grader off of a
computer [LAUGH].

00:24:46.483 --> 00:24:47.316
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH].

00:24:47.316 --> 00:24:49.500
&gt;&gt; And I said, what's going on here?

00:24:49.500 --> 00:24:52.910
And people are already commenting, and
