00:25:08.851 --> 00:25:11.609
And my brain immediately said, those
videos were

00:25:11.609 --> 00:25:13.915
for Nadia, not for, not for Bill Gates.

00:25:13.915 --> 00:25:13.965
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH].

00:25:13.965 --> 00:25:17.618
&gt;&gt; This is, you know, I, I have to really
