00:25:31.063 --> 00:25:35.263
world, because this event happened some
place in reality.

00:25:35.263 --> 00:25:37.544
But, I was like you know, what do I do
now?

00:25:37.544 --> 00:25:38.922
Do I call him [LAUGH], you know?

00:25:38.922 --> 00:25:41.839
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH].

00:25:41.839 --> 00:25:42.642
&gt;&gt; Can I find his number?

00:25:42.642 --> 00:25:44.235
I don't think so.

00:25:44.235 --> 00:25:47.570
And, and, and, but luckily, that kind of
