00:26:14.510 --> 00:26:15.969
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH].

00:26:15.969 --> 00:26:17.177
And it was completely blank.

00:26:17.177 --> 00:26:17.660
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH].

00:26:17.660 --> 00:26:20.528
And so, [LAUGH] so, I was like yeah, you
know,

00:26:20.528 --> 00:26:25.028
maybe like next Wednesday, 2:45, I could
