00:26:28.054 --> 00:26:32.250
you know, laundry, I can squeeze, squeeze
Bill Gates in.

00:26:32.250 --> 00:26:35.217
And, and so, I, I flew up to Seattle, met

00:26:35.217 --> 00:26:39.173
with Bill Gates, which was a surreal
meeting, you know?

00:26:39.173 --> 00:26:41.332
20% of my brain was in the meeting, the
other 80% was, this is Bill Gates!

00:26:41.332 --> 00:26:42.590
That's Bill Gates!

00:26:42.590 --> 00:26:44.087
What would happen if I hit him?

00:26:44.087 --> 00:26:44.367
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH].

00:26:44.367 --> 00:26:52.721
What would happen if I [LAUGH] I didn't
want to but you, you can imagine.

00:26:52.721 --> 00:26:57.181
So, so, but, but you know, I presented,
and you know, there was an awkward moment

00:26:57.181 --> 00:27:01.269
where I had, I had these, I called them my
