practises, document them.

00:57:05.932 --> 00:57:07.279
If we can make tools for them, so they

00:57:07.279 --> 00:57:09.410
can happily use in a classroom, we wanna
build them.

00:57:09.410 --> 00:57:11.262
Or at minimum, document them so that other
teachers

00:57:11.262 --> 00:57:13.040
